        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami wakabuzya Ziba kuti, Ino ezi zintu zili amulimonzi? Nkabela Ziba wakavuwa kuti, Imbongolo nzyakutanta basiŋanda bamwami, azinkwa amicelo nzyakulya balombe, awaini ngwakunywa abo bakateede munkanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
