        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami wakaambila Ziba kuti, Bona! Zintu zyoonse zya-Mefibosete zyaba zyako, Nkabela Ziba wakati, Twakabomba! Nkajane luzyalo kumeso aamwami simalelaangu.",
