        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova wakubweedezezya mulandu wabulowa boonse bwaluzubo lwa-Saulo nguwakanyanzya bwami bwakwe. Jehova waaba bwami mumaanza aamwanaako Abisalomu. Sunu wasikilwa mapenzi, nkaambo uli sibulowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
