            "sid": "2SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi Davida wakaambila Abisai abalanda bakwe kuti, Amubone! Mwanaangu iwakazwa mubula bwangu ndemwini uli mukuyandaula buumi bwangu. Lino oyu mwana wa-Benjamini­ sa takooinda kucita obo na? Amumuleke, atuke, nkaambo Jehova nguwakamulailila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
