              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Husai wakavwiila Abisalomu kuti, Pe, nkaambo oyo ngwasala Jehova angubasala aba bantu abantu boonse ba-Israyeli, ambebo ndeelede kuba wakwe akukala awe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
