        {
          "text": "Nkabela Ahitofeli wakaambila Abisalomu kuti, Koswanaana abasimamambe bauso mbaakasia kuti balindile iŋanda, elyo ba-Israyeli boonse balamvwa kuti bauso bakusesemwa, aboobo maanza aabo boonse mboli abo alayumizigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
