                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo bakabambila Abisalomu itente atala alululi, nkabela wakaswanaana abasimamambe bawisi mumeso aaba-Israyeli boonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
