                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino lulungunwido lwa-Ahitofeli ndwaakalungununa mumazuba alya akayeeyegwa mbuli majwi aa-Leza. Mbuboobu mbulwakabede lulungunwido lwakwe loonse, nikuba kuli-Davida nikuba kuli-Abisalomu.",
          "type": "text",
